  and recent-designs picker so all current multi-upload behaviour
  keeps working. After a file is selected the tabs hide themselves
  so the regular order-selection UI takes over.

  Usage (inside sections/bySizeNew.liquid, `when "fileupload"` case):
    {% render 'dtf-upload-tabs',
         product: product,
         section: section,
         block: block %}
